00:37:44,270 --> 00:38:08,548
So, this is just kind of a small first step, I would say, towards, I think what we're gonna see over the next couple of years with these types of systems where initially all the tasks in AI research that are measurable and very fast to evaluate, the systems like this will do work that is far past the ability of human researchers to be able to do very soon.

